Third-party code and patches
----------------------------

patches/doubletake.patch
    Changes to doubletake (https://github.com/omarroth/doubletake), an AirPlay 2
    sender licensed LGPL-3.0-or-later. This patch is a derivative of doubletake
    and is likewise licensed LGPL-3.0-or-later. scripts/fetch-upstreams.sh
    downloads the upstream source at the commit in patches/BASES.txt and applies
    the patch; a doubletake binary built from it is covered by the LGPL, whose
    source is that commit plus this patch.

